[[Shading Willow]] is a [[Renown heart]] vendor in [[Lowland Shore]]. [[Assist the Kodan around Autumn's Vale]], and Shading Willow will offer their wares.

== Location ==
;[[Janthir]]
* [[Lowland Shore]]
** [[Autumn's Vale]]

== Heart involvement ==
: {{heart|Assist the Kodan around Autumn's Vale}}

