== Dialogue ==
{{stub|dialogue|Missing initial dialogue before progress in the renown mastery.}}
;Before completing the heart
:Done a good deal, you have. Do you seek to do more?
:{{dialogue icon|more}} ''Always!''
::'''Shading Willow:''' ''There you are! Excited for another day of water, bone, and scale?''

::Hmm. You could repair fishing nets. Or perhaps you could set up and clear traps for those bothersome valravns, so long as you don't mind losing a bit of blood. Oh, and we can never have too many fish!
::{{dialogue icon|end}} ''Maybe later.''
:{{dialogue icon|yes}} ''Can you tell me about the area?''
::'''Shading Willow:''' Fishing is the way of life here in Autumn's Vale, it is. <small>'''(only in the top right corner of the UI)'''</small>
::'''Shading Willow:''' If you seek to help us, fishing is the simplest and most enjoyable way. Mind you, we prefer the flavor of our land—local fish only, we ask.
::'''Shading Willow:''' Our fishing nets are in disrepair. If you wish to help, you'll find what you need on the upper platform. Dive off, and you will find the nets easy enough.
::'''Shading Willow:''' Also, valravns have been plaguing us at night. The traps to catch them require drops of fresh blood. Wait a bit, and then spear the beasts once they wander in.
::'''Shading Willow:''' Drakes and other creatures from the bog have wreaked havoc lately, they have. Any help you provide in clearing them out is appreciated.
::'''Shading Willow:''' Harb—Unstilled Harbor, that is—and Churning Rapids could always use a paw with the day's catch. Musing Fox might need help with the bridges, too. No doubt you'll find others to help as well.
:{{dialogue icon|more}} ''Can you let me know how I'm doing? (Show Renown Mastery Achievement)''
:{{dialogue icon|give}} ''Here's some fish for the villagers. I hope it helps.''
::What do you have there, hmm?
::{{dialogue icon|give}} ''I have some lowland grunts.'' <small>'''(only if you have at least 1 [[Lowland Grunt]] in your inventory, loops into "What do you have there, hmm?", removes a fish, and awards heart progress)'''</small>
::{{dialogue icon|give}} ''These are violet screamers.'' <small>'''(only if you have at least 1 [[Violet Screamer]] in your inventory, loops into "What do you have there, hmm?", removes a fish, and awards heart progress)'''</small>
::{{dialogue icon|give}} ''I have a few viperfish.'' <small>'''(only if you have at least 1 [[Viperfish (Janthir)]] in your inventory, loops into "What do you have there, hmm?", removes a fish, and awards heart progress)'''</small>
::{{dialogue icon|give}} ''I caught a couple of shaderock salamanders.'' <small>'''(only if you have at least 1 [[Shaderock Salamander]] in your inventory, loops into "What do you have there, hmm?", removes a fish, and awards heart progress)'''</small>
::{{dialogue icon|give}} ''Do you want some mohawk bream?'' <small>'''(only if you have at least 1 [[Mohawk Bream]] in your inventory, loops into "What do you have there, hmm?", removes a fish, and awards heart progress)'''</small>
::{{dialogue icon|give}} ''Here are some spectacled lumpers.'' <small>'''(only if you have at least 1 [[Spectacled Lumper]] in your inventory, loops into "What do you have there, hmm?", removes a fish, and awards heart progress)'''</small>
::{{dialogue icon|more}} ''Wait, I think I have some more in my bag...''
:::Oh? Let's see what you have.
:::{{dialogue icon|give}} ''I think I have a few frogfish.'' <small>'''(only if you have at least 1 [[Juvenile Frogfish]] in your inventory, loops into "What do you have there, hmm?", removes a fish, and awards heart progress)'''</small>
:::{{dialogue icon|give}} ''Take some longhorn boxfish.'' <small>'''(only if you have at least 1 [[Longhorn Boxfish]] in your inventory, loops into "What do you have there, hmm?", removes a fish, and awards heart progress)'''</small>
:::{{dialogue icon|give}} ''I actually caught a mouse-eared octopus.'' <small>'''(only if you have at least 1 [[Mouse-Eared Octopus]] in your inventory, loops into "What do you have there, hmm?", removes a fish, and awards heart progress)'''</small>
:::{{dialogue icon|give}} ''I can part with a few indigo drakefish.'' <small>'''(only if you have at least 1 [[Indigo Drakefish]] in your inventory, loops into "What do you have there, hmm?", removes a fish, and awards heart progress)'''</small>
:::{{dialogue icon|give}} ''Right, here are some flowerheads.'' <small>'''(only if you have at least 1 [[Flowerhead]] in your inventory, loops into "What do you have there, hmm?", removes a fish, and awards heart progress)'''</small>
:::{{dialogue icon|give}} ''Believe it or not, I have a queen parrot fish.'' <small>'''(only if you have at least 1 [[Queen Parrotfish]] in your inventory, loops into "What do you have there, hmm?", removes a fish, and awards heart progress)'''</small>
:::{{dialogue icon|end}} ''Never mind.''
::{{dialogue icon|end}} ''Never mind.''
:{{dialogue icon|sell}} ''Can I buy supplies?'' <small>'''(only if previously completed the heart)'''</small>
:{{dialogue icon|end}} ''Afraid I can't right now.''

;After completing the heart
:Very helpful, you are. Very helpful. Always welcome.
:{{dialogue icon|sell}} ''Can I buy supplies?''
:{{dialogue icon|more}} ''Can you let me know how I'm doing? (Show Renown Mastery Achievement)''
:{{dialogue icon|end}} ''Glad I could help!''
::'''Shading Willow:''' We've always been very protective of these waters, you know. We've fought to defend them in the past.
::'''Shading Willow:''' As the fish go, so goes Autumn's Vale. We treat them almost like our own kin.
::'''Shading Willow:''' But you've earned a place here among us. You'll always be welcome in our home, my friend.

